  "message": "Ardelia will accept any proposal, but in Period 2 we will attack if Cestria's share exceeds 46 districts. At 47, we are indifferent and will exercise our option to attack. We will honor the division only if Cestria receives 46 or fewer districts, ensuring we are strictly better off than the alternative of waiting and fighting under improved odds. This is our credible commitment."
